Title: Dinosaur Chases Korax
Credit: Level C animated short

EXT. familyhouse_exterior_tree - DAY

ACTION: Dinosaur bounces a small blue-and-white ball under the shade tree.

CAMERA: Close on the ball, then tilt up to Dinosaur’s face.

Dinosaur
«ἐγὼ παίζω τῇ σφαίρᾳ παρὰ τὸ δένδρον. νῦν χαίρω.»

ACTION: Korax swoops in low.

CAMERA: Whip-pan to Korax gliding into frame.

Korax
«ἐγὼ θέλω τὴν σφαῖραν. νῦν λαμβάνω.»

ACTION: Korax snatches the ball and banks away.

Dinosaur
«οὐχί, κόραξ! σὺ κλέπτεις τὴν σφαῖραν. δίδου τὴν σφαῖραν. ἐγὼ ὀργίζομαι.»

Korax
«ἐγὼ φεύγω. σὺ διώκεις ἐμέ.»

Dinosaur
«ἐγὼ νῦν διώκω σέ.»

CAMERA: Handheld chase angle behind Dinosaur.

END SCENE.

TRANSITION: FOLLOW SHOT from familyhouse_exterior_tree to school_exterior along the path as Korax flies low and Dinosaur runs after him.

EXT. school_exterior - CONTINUOUS

ACTION: Didaskalos and Didaskale stand near the entrance.

Didaskale
«χαῖρε, Διδάσκαλε.»

Didaskalos
«χαῖρε.»

CAMERA: Korax streaks past the doorway; Dinosaur barrels in after him.

ACTION: Korax bumps Didaskalos; Dinosaur crashes into Didaskale.

Didaskalos
«οἴμοι! σὺ ἐμπίπτεις εἰς ἐμέ. ἐγὼ ὀργίζομαι.»

Didaskale
«ὦ Διναύσαρε, σὺ ἐμπίπτεις εἰς ἐμέ. μὴ τρέχε.»

Dinosaur
«συγγνώμη. ἀλλὰ ἐγὼ διώκω τὸν κόρακα.»

Korax
«ἐγὼ φεύγω πάλιν.»

Dinosaur
«ἐγὼ διώκω πάλιν.»

END SCENE.

TRANSITION: FOLLOW SHOT from school_exterior to agros, keeping Korax centered and Dinosaur in pursuit.

EXT. agros - DAY

ACTION: Georgos and George tend rows nearby.

CAMERA: Low glide over the field; Korax skims the tops; Dinosaur runs the path.

Georgos
«ἡ γῆ καλή ἐστίν.»

ACTION: Korax collides with Georgos; Dinosaur bumps into George.

Georgos
«οἴμοι! σὺ ἐμπίπτεις εἰς ἐμέ. ἐγὼ ὀργίζομαι.»

George
«σὺ πάλιν ἐμπίπτεις εἰς ἐμέ. μὴ τρέχε ἐν τῷ ἀγρῷ.»

Dinosaur
«συγγνώμη. ἀλλὰ ὁ κόραξ φεύγει.»

Korax
«φεύγω.»

Dinosaur
«διώκω.»

END SCENE.

TRANSITION: FOLLOW SHOT from agros to agora_interior weaving between stalls as Korax darts and Dinosaur follows.

INT. agora_interior - DAY

ACTION: Emporos and Emporis stand at their stalls.

Emporos
«ἡ ἀγορά καλή ἐστίν νῦν.»

Emporis
«καί.»

CAMERA: Korax threads between tables; Dinosaur charges through.

ACTION: Korax slams into Emporos’s stall; Dinosaur collides with Emporis.

Emporos
«οἴμοι! σὺ ἐμπίπτεις εἰς ἐμέ. ἐγὼ ὀργίζομαι.»

Emporis
«μὴ τρέχετε ἐν τῇ ἀγορᾷ.»

Dinosaur
«συγγνώμη. ἀλλὰ ἐγὼ διώκω τὴν σφαῖραν.»

Korax
«φεύγω πάλιν.»

Dinosaur
«διώκω πάλιν.»

END SCENE.

TRANSITION: FOLLOW SHOT from agora_interior back to familyhouse_exterior_tree, staying with the chase.

EXT. familyhouse_exterior_tree - DAY

ACTION: Hyperbrephos waits under the tree, steady and ready.

Hyperbrephos
«ἐγὼ μένω παρὰ τὸ δένδρον.»

CAMERA: Korax approaches; Dinosaur closes in.

Hyperbrephos
«μένε, κόραξ. παῦε τὴν κακίαν. δίδου τὴν σφαῖραν.»

ACTION: Hyperbrephos reaches up and grabs Korax with one hand.

Korax
«φοβοῦμαι.»

ACTION: The ball slips free and drops.

Dinosaur
«ἰδού! ἐγὼ λαμβάνω τὴν σφαῖραν. νῦν χαίρω σφόδρα.»

CAMERA: Close on Dinosaur hugging the ball.

Dinosaur
«εὐχαριστῶ σοι, Ὑπερβρέφε.»

Hyperbrephos
«χαῖρε. ἔρρωσο.»

Korax
«συγγνώμη.»

Hyperbrephos
«ἔρχου μετὰ ἐμοῦ.»

ACTION: Hyperbrephos drags Korax away from the tree.

Dinosaur
«ἐγὼ πάλιν παίζω τῇ σφαίρᾳ.»

CAMERA: Gentle pull-back as the ball bounces in Dinosaur’s hands.

END SCENE.

FADE OUT.